        "nodeType": "bounded_task",
        "objective": "Fix WF-A-FORMAL-002 in src/ahra/adapters/codex_sdk.py:\nCodexSDKDriver must support AgentRunRequest expected outputs\nAlignmentTurnDecision, RequirementDraft, and AcceptanceDraft as\ndefined in src/ahra/alignment_session.py. For each, the driver\nprompts Codex for JSON matching the expected output contract and\nconverts it into the structured AgentRunResult that\nAlignmentSessionManager consumes. Malformed model JSON must be\nrejected with a structured error, never an unhandled crash. Do not\nimport the Codex SDK anywhere outside the adapter, and do not\nmodify src/ahra/ports.py. Add fake-client tests in\ntests/test_codex_sdk_driver.py (or the existing Codex driver test\nmodule) covering all three outputs and the malformed-JSON path.\nRun uv run python -B scripts/check.py --test and record it in\nWorkReport.verification_commands_run.\n",
